<!-- ============================================================
     3. GAM-RAG — 积累检索经验+Kalman增益，raw+EMA被覆盖降为消融
     ============================================================ -->
  <bib:Article rdf:about="#item_GAM_RAG">
    <z:itemType>preprint</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>GAM-RAG: Gain-Adaptive Memory for Evolving Retrieval in Retrieval-Augmented Generation</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2026</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.01783</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>arXiv:2603.01783</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>[GrowRAG-竞品] 【原方案raw+EMA被覆盖，降为消融】复旦。三层图(entity→sentence→passage)+Kalman gain在线更新句子记忆向量。+3.95%(0-turn)/+8.19%(5-turn)，推理成本-61%。【差异化】GAM-RAG需图结构；我们不需图，更plug-and-play，且有NO_MEMORY一等动作。Zotero存储：3HGLTY4D</z:extra>
    <bib:authors>
      <rdf:Seq>
        <rdf:li><foaf:Person><foaf:surname>Wang</foaf:surname><foaf:givenName>Yifan</foaf:givenName></foaf:Person></rdf:li>
