<!-- ============================================================
     4. ExpWeaver — 经验调用时机研究，门控器想法已被覆盖
     ============================================================ -->
  <bib:Article rdf:about="#item_ExpWeaver">
    <z:itemType>preprint</z:itemType>
    <dc:title>Rethinking Experience Utilization in Self-Evolving Language Model Agents</dc:title>
    <dc:date>2026</dc:date>
    <z:url>https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.07164</z:url>
    <dc:identifier>arXiv:2605.07164</dc:identifier>
    <z:extra>[GrowRAG-竞品] 【何时调用经验已被覆盖】发现always-on差于init-only；ExpWeaver让agent选择性调用经验。4框架×7LLM×3环境。RL可放大选择性调用。【启示】三路决策(NO_MEMORY/REUSE/RE_REFLECT)有依据，但我们不把"调用时机"当主创新。Zotero存储：3SZRD3XK</z:extra>
